  "description": "Spurman, who saved humanity once again from the Sage Corps, is now locked in a secret chamber? The reality that befell Spurman, who woke up in an unfamiliar place, was a confined space and various strange and embarrassing things (?) Having encountered traps and traps, Spurman meets new abilities and resolves the crisis, but will he be able to escape this place alive?\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=775723), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6380600) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/COMEDY/sperman4/list?title_no=3389), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0000453)",
